  "scope": "PV-T05 activate explicit eleven-public-factory-kind complete transport in ordinary and compatible profiles. Preserve existing payload representations without conversion; reject null duration/string and malformed QName field structure. Existing complete admission, quotas, raw lifetime, paired proof checks and scalar registry/evaluation remain unchanged. No public declaration/type/layout/friend/reference delta.",
  "intentionalExtensions": "Bosak carrier-preserving host boundary and structural subset follow PP01-PP18 Core policy beyond XDM API requirements. No independent lexical/schema/calendar validity, scalar/numeric/construction expansion, invented Uri/Binary public factories or owner/native/budget/freeze/publication acceptance."
